<li><strong>The morning''s three-scenario framework collapsed because the day was non-binary.</strong><span> Ceasefire path, extension path, and escalation path all materialized within eight hours. Tomorrow''s open is a reaction to which fragment of today the market re-anchors to overnight.</span></li>
