<li><strong>The ceasefire eases the inflation side of the trap partially and temporarily.</strong><span> Wednesday''s oil drop reduces near-term CPI pressure. Thursday''s partial reversal and the still-closed strait mean the easing is conditional, not structural.</span></li>
