<li><strong>The CUSMA joint review deadline is June 2026.</strong><span> Canada''s trade relationship with the U.S. remains the deeper, longer-duration risk sitting beneath six weeks of oil shock headlines.</span></li>
</ul>' WHERE slug = '2026/04/09/canadas-stagflation-trap-why-the-ceasefire-doesnt-solve-the-bocs-real-problem';

UPDATE articles SET brief_html = '<ul>
